  "description": "Comfortable, upright and versatile, the 26\"-wheeled LXi 6.1 will handle your neighborhood roads with aplomb. The heart of your smooth ride is our high quality LXi 6061 aluminum frame, paired with a 50 mm suspension fork. It's all gain and no pain with the Del Sol comfort saddle and suspension seat post, Del Sol comfort grips and adjustable stem.\nDel Sol lightweight 6061 frame with upright comfort geometry\nUltra-compliant 50mm travel suspension fork\nShimano 21 speed Tourney derailleurs with Revo twist shifters\nAdjustable angle alloy stem and lightweight steel handlebars\nCustom Del Sol comfort plus saddle with suspension seatpost\nLightweight 32 hole alloy wheelset with doublewall rims\nSmooth rolling 26\" all-purpose tires",
